                                "sense_id": "e10c6dfd-31b7-3eb2-beb9-5f7e3977b542",
                                "text": "All the servants were there in the hall — all the dear friends — all the young ladies — the dancing-master who had just arrived; and there was such a scuffling, and hugging, and kissing, and crying, with the hysterical yoops of Miss Swartz […]"
                            },
                            {
