                                "sense_id": "e10c6dfd-31b7-3eb2-beb9-5f7e3977b542",
                                "text": "And Terice shrieked again and Helene gave a hysterical yoop. \"Stop that!\" ordered O'Leary sharply. As Terice, her mouth still open, stared at him and Helene nearly strangled on a sob, he added: \"See here, we are in a rather terrible situation. […]"
